    "body": "Scope note from the maintainer. The group titled \"Work offset\" on main has two rows. Row 1 is \"Set WCS from features\" with the \"Pick for WCS\" button. Row 2 is the \"Work offset\" dropdown. Both rows go to the WCS page, and the group leaves the Setup page. PR #1717 moves row 2. This issue moves row 1 and its role picks. The Setup page keeps \"Active setup\", \"Stock source\", \"Part orientation\" and \"This setup\" unchanged.",
